Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:59:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 086/191] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the split
 view's pane names: fetch when the list fails, end Loading..., refetch only on
 a rename

A pane outside the list now fetches its row once the list has loaded or failed, and reads Loading... only while that fetch is pending, so a failed fetch or list falls back to the frame title or Untitled session. The frame-title watcher refetches only when a pane's name changes from one name to another and forgets panes that left the layout. aeFrameTitleName reuses UNTITLED_CONVERSATION_LABEL and DEFAULT_APP_NAME, and the comments are shorter.
